      "structure_unit_id": "su-994a2301e062de6b53581c0b",
      "study_phase": "phase_ii",
      "table_context": null,
      "unit_kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "研究者应跟踪每例次不良事件，直至达到下列任何情况之一：",
